msgid ""
"Now, we run a larger example on a real QPU.\n"
"For the reference energy, we use the results of a [DMRG](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Density_matrix_renormalization_group) calculation that was performed separately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini, kami menjalankan contoh yang lebih besar pada QPU sebenar.\n"
"Untuk tenaga rujukan, kami menggunakan keputusan pengiraan [DMRG](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Density_matrix_renormalization_group) yang dilakukan secara berasingan.\n"

